        "title": "The chart shows the percentages of Chinese and Indian students in Canadian universities in various provinces in 2009. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GPEMdBMAgou5k5xYuFplg8rogIh\"><em><strong>The chart shows the percentages of Chinese and Indian students in Canadian universities in various provinces in 2009. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Chinese &amp; Indian Students in Canadian Universities: 2009</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SaSKdM1JpoWdT8xr5WclDARzg0d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Đề b&agrave;i Chinese &amp; Indian Students in Canadian Universities: 2009 y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả tỷ lệ sinh vi&ecirc;n Chinese v&agrave; Indian trong c&aacute;c trường đại học ở c&aacute;c tỉnh bang của Canada v&agrave;o năm 2009.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xhs7d86SRoM5VWxMeeHl2lASgmc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuong-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tương đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span> trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-JjandWvDDoSdQTx3r3XlndMfg4f\">Paraphrase đề Chinese &amp; Indian Students in Canadian Universities: 2009 với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: tỷ lệ phần trăm - sinh vi&ecirc;n Chinese v&agrave; Indian - học đại học - 9 tỉnh bang - 2009.</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-JjandWvDDoSdQTx3r3XlndMfg4f\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-JjandWvDDoSdQTx3r3XlndMfg4f\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D9n2dT6reoUXRNx42urlLISBgH9\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề kh&ocirc;ng thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IGyjdCCmNoNsJMxOIIblTD7wgPh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Sinh vi&ecirc;n Chinese chiếm tỷ lệ cao hơn ở hầu hết c&aacute;c tỉnh, ngoại trừ Alberta.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RhBGdssNdoh7nBxbXBElrx25g2e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<p>New Brunswick c&oacute; tỷ lệ cao nhất với cả 2 nh&oacute;m sinh vi&ecirc;n, trong khi Prince Edward Island l&agrave; tỉnh duy nhất kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; sinh vi&ecirc;n Indian.&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kd5JdEBw0oISfhxnssflqArQg8f\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kd5JdEBw0oISfhxnssflqArQg8f\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OX1gdCRrtod522x0UeRlIDligOg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UGGwdIZxlo7V74x7HwAlLxV9g0f\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> </strong><strong>C&aacute;c tỉnh bang c&oacute; tỉ lệ cao&nbsp;</strong></span></h4>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OfRwdFGKfovhqsxRicrlH4FngJc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu của New Brunswick</strong> <em>(<strong>dẫn đầu</strong> với 12% v&agrave; 7%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AfJ7dvcCQowyyjxGWoClGy5Rg5g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>So s&aacute;nh tỷ lệ sinh vi&ecirc;n ở Nova Scotia v&agrave; British Columbia</strong> <em>(khoảng 10.5% sinh vi&ecirc;n Chinese vs. 6.3% &amp; 4.4% với sinh vi&ecirc;n Indian)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Doa7dxCwvoVVdxxi15IllOa2gHf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả tỷ lệ sinh vi&ecirc;n ở&nbsp;Quebec</strong> <em>(8% Chinese, cao hơn Indian 2%)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MgYDdoyFio8XVcxaPADlwlNogYc\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MgYDdoyFio8XVcxaPADlwlNogYc\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2:</strong><strong> </strong><strong>C&aacute;c tỉnh bang c&ograve;n lại</strong></span></h4>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Fn7ndDDxZohRm8x4bL8louZigWg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>M&ocirc; tả Alberta </strong><em>(tỉnh duy nhất c&oacute; tỷ lệ sinh vi&ecirc;n Ấn Độ cao hơn Trung Quốc, 5.5% vs. 4%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QN3ody7eeoNnUtxbYOGl6C0pgTg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>So s&aacute;nh tỷ lệ sinh vi&ecirc;n ở Yukon, Manitoba v&agrave; Ontario</strong> <em>(từ khoảng 7.5% tới thấp nhất l&agrave; 6% Chinese v&agrave;&nbsp;<strong>tỉ lệ Indian ở 3 khu vực n&agrave;y đều thấp hơn Chinese </strong>khoảng 2.5%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PUG8dpXuSopksNxrD9cljoflg8b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả Prince Edward Island</strong> <em>(5% sinh vi&ecirc;n Chinese v&agrave; <strong>kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; sinh vi&ecirc;n India</strong>)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A4hWdWm6ro21qpx8VQblBuprgAh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bc2gdrij0o2chcxcadllSjTsgke\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XdYcdsZ6Uo6tuXxGPs3lNnJUgHh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DKR6dLMaeoXxeTxrXRSlEEvNg0c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AzYTdFzRgorC1Sxrgbnlmn3Ag1d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Trong b&agrave;i n&agrave;y, m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể thay từ \"students\" bằng c&aacute;c từ như \"nationals/attendees\" để chỉ c&aacute;c sinh vi&ecirc;n Chinese v&agrave; Indian nh&eacute;!&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AzYTdFzRgorC1Sxrgbnlmn3Ag1d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong>&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AzYTdFzRgorC1Sxrgbnlmn3Ag1d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">New Brunswick took the lead, as it was comprised of roughly 12% and 7% <strong>Chinese and Indian nationals</strong>, respectively.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AzYTdFzRgorC1Sxrgbnlmn3Ag1d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Additionally, the numbers of Chinese students in Yukon, Manitoba and Ontario ranged from slightly above 7.5% to as low as 6%, while Indian <strong>attendees </strong>came in at roughly 2.5% lower in all three provinces.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 245,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction ",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y4BTd53FPop3SxxzykilfSvIgTe\">The bar chart lists the percentages of Chinese and Indian students who were attending universities in 9 different provinces of Canada in 2009.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13669,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 246,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TIcfdojlfoVL6GxKnrZlfLv8gNd\">Overall, Chinese students outnumbered their Indian counterparts in all the given provinces, with the exception of Alberta. In addition, the figures for New Brunswick were the largest in terms of both Chinese and Indian students, while no students from India chose P.E.I. as their place of study.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13669,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 247,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p>Regarding the most popular destinations, New Brunswick took the lead, as it was comprised of roughly 12% and 7% Chinese and Indian nationals, respectively. A similar percentage of around 10.5% was seen in the figures for Chinese students in both Nova Scotia and British Columbia, while Indian students, in turn, accounted for just approximately 6.3% and 4.4%. Meanwhile, Quebec reported that slightly over 8% of their students were Chinese, which was about 2% higher than Indian citizens.</p>",
            "question_id": 13669,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 248,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2 ",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JciTdsH0to46a5xgI9SlnJAhgRe\">As for the remaining provinces, in Alberta alone, students from India surpassed those from China, at approximately 5.5% and just above 4%, respectively. Additionally, the numbers of Chinese students in Yukon, Manitoba and Ontario ranged from slightly above 7.5% to as low as 6%, while Indian attendees came in at roughly 2.5% lower in all three provinces. Finally, Prince Edward Island was the only province with no reported students coming from India, although there remained slightly under 5% who were Chinese.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 13669,
